  "description": "Whole-exome sequencing and neoantigen landscape analysis of 93 metastatic pancreatic adenocarcinomas and their matched normals from a randomized phase 2 trial evaluating the efficacy of nivolumab and/or sotigalimab with gemcitabine/nab-paclitaxel (chemotherapy) as first-line therapy for metastatic pancreatic cancer. The reprocessing of raw sequencing data is coordinated by <a href=\"https://cri-iatlas.org/\">CRI iAtlas</a>.",
